# #5840 S4: the live donor, superseded by the fence the shard root ran at the link,
# deactivates.
MODULE: LiveDonorProgressLiveDonorSupersededByLinkFence
TARGET: LiveDonorProgress
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a StaleEpoch at the live donor's current epoch after the link fence supersedes it, with no probed re-claim: #5840 S4 as raised
PERTURBS: LiveStamp
BOUNDS: WithStaleDonor = TRUE, WithPreArm = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1

--- FIND
         [] ~lAllow -> /\ eRow < MaxEpoch
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no re-claim allowance.
         [] FALSE -> /\ eRow < MaxEpoch
--- END
